# Allowlist for sensitive term false positives in public repo.
# Format: filepath_glob|term
# filepath_glob uses shell glob syntax (matched against relative path from repo root).
# term is the exact blocklist entry that should be suppressed for matching files.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.

# Public federal judge pages — these names overlap with blocklist entries
# but refer to unrelated public judges, not case-specific individuals.
judges/*|Pappas
judges/*|Fink

# Sitemap URLs reference judge page paths -- same false positives
sitemap.xml|Pappas
sitemap.xml|Fink
